DESCRIPTION:Blockobana is back for 2026! We&#x27\;re back at Barbara Hall 
 Park this year and the bar experience is being revamped! Blockobana is bac
 k for 2026\, and we&#x27\;re back at Barbara Hall Park. Blockobana is a da
 y filled with music\, food\, and fun. Get ready for Toronto&#x27\;s best D
 Js and live performers. Please register your tickets and we will update th
 e location of the event shortly...and please spread the word that we are N
 OT returning to our previous location! Blockobana is a safe space for LGBT
 QI+ African\, Black\, and Caribbean folk and our allies\, friends and fami
 lies. This is not a space for homophobia\, transphobia\, anti-Black Racism
  and generally\, please make sure you leave badmind at home. Blockobana is
  also not a BYOB space\, we will have bars on site and ask that you do not
  bring in outside liquids. Bar revenue helps us to continue this event int
 o upcoming years. We&#x27\;re reworking our bar set up to ensure easier an
 d faster access. DJ Line Up so far: Blackcatt Craig Dominic Funded by: Tor
 onto Arts Council Cabenuva In Collaboration with: Toronto Black Pride Tasl
 an Protective Services ‍
LOCATION:Barbara Hall Park\, 519 Church Street
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/blockobana-2026
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
