BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SUPERSEXE - BEACH PARTY!
DTSTART:20260802T220000
DTEND:20260802T220000
UID:266375146836c4ff661f4e72fc7ec878@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Join us in the midnight sun August 2 for the Beach Party Editi
 on of SUPERSEXE! Come indulge in the one-of-a-kind silliness\, and delicio
 usly Pure Campy fashion at the 30th installment of Stella Maise&#x27\;s so
 lo collective show\; SUPERSEXE. Doors open at 10:00pm \; doors close at 1:
 30am $20 at the door 10pm-1am\, $5 after 1am! Events ends at 2:30am. SUPER
 SEXE LINEUP Stella Maise (@estellamaise on IG) WITH SPECIAL GUEST DJs OGQT
  (@ogqt on IG) Miss Bible (@missbiblexo on IG) Location: SeeScape\, 347 Ke
 ele St. T.O (This venue is unfortunately inaccessible\, no entry ramp avai
 lable. The show will be taking place in the upstairs area which is only ac
 cessible by stairs. Apologies for any limitations caused\; we look forward
  to our future events that are within fully accessible venues!) Theme: BEA
 CH PARTY (Bikinis\, Towels\, snorkels) Music Vibe: Music vibes will be Clu
 b\, Electrohouse\, Techno\, Pop\, Girlypop Bass &amp\; beyond. An eclectic
  compilation of delicious cult hits and deep cuts. Important: This is not 
 an adult play/kink/s3x party. Supersexe is an event for queer/trans/femme 
 presenting people. If you do not fall under this bracket\, you must be acc
 ompanied by someone who does. NO REFUNDS Behind SUPERSEXE: A queer-led eve
 nt\, spotlighting alternative artists and performers. SUPERSEXE is named a
 fter the now-closed Montreal-based strip club\, Super Sexe\, that unfortun
 ately burnt down in 2021. I (Stella) had always wanted to go since I was a
  kid. The glitzy exterior\, the beautiful femme style\, the extravagance. 
 I wanted to encapsulate the image in my head of what could&#x27\;ve been t
 hrough this series (yes\, series!) of SUPERSEXE. ‍
LOCATION:See-Scape\, 347 Keele St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/supersexe---beach-party
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
