BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:WINE DUNG!: QUEERIBANA FETE PT. 2 w/ RAMZ\, SELA VIE\, TRINIDADDY 
 &amp\; YOUNG ZEE
DTSTART:20260802T220000
DTEND:20260802T220000
UID:18fe9b00ac7ed514f579e62eec1fc991@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Close out Caribana weekend with your queer kin and wine on ah 
 cutie to pure soca\, chutney\, bouyon\, and dancehall all night! WINE DUNG
 !: QUEERIBANA FETE PT. 2 w/ RAMZ\, SELA VIE\, TRINIDADDY &amp\; YOUNG ZEE 
 Hello cuties! Happy belated Pride and Happy soon-to-be Bana weekend! We mi
 ssed you all during Pride season... but we&#x27\;ve been working really ha
 rd behind the scenes taking some of your feedback and looking at new venue
 s to expand your new fave queer fete! Before di summah done\, we had to th
 row one last fete fuh allyuh! We&#x27\;re back with a Queeribana edition! 
 Come close out Caribana long weekend with us on Sunday\, August 2nd from 1
 0 PM to 2 AM at Hail Mary on College! We are celebrating our peoples and p
 aying homage to the power of SOCA! Lots of soca alllll night - classic soc
 a\, bashment soca\, Dennery Segment\, Jab\, Zess - alongside some of your 
 other fave sounds from around the diaspora (chutney\, bouyon\, dancehall\,
  reggae\, kompa\, zouk\, etc...) Come celebrate with your queer Caribbean 
 kin\, jump up with your chosen fam\, and wine on ah cutie with a few of th
 e best queer Caribbean DJs in the city supplying di vibes. All batty gyals
 \, bais\, dey/dems\, famalay and hawt babes gender non-specific or conform
 ing welcome! Bring yuh flags &amp\; fans (cause it gets HOT) - rep your Ca
 ribbean nation\, your sexuality\, and your gender if you&#x27\;d like. All
  of these flags are welcome in this space! SELECTORS: RAMZ (@ramz.mp3) SEL
 A VIE (@djselavie) TRINIDADDY (@trinixdaddy) YOUNG ZEE (_djyoungzee) $15-2
 5 per ticket sliding scale online through Eventbrite. Few tickets will be 
 available at the door $20-25 sliding scale through Eventbrite or $25 cash 
 - please try and buy in advance since space is limited\, and ticket holder
 s will be prioritized for entry before 12 AM. Entry is based on capacity a
 fter 12 AM for ticket holders and people buying tickets at the door. Event
  is 19+\, IDs will be checked and bags will be checked at the door. Every 
 queer person is welcome in this space\, and we ask that everyone stay mind
 ful and respectful of this being a BIPOC and queer Caribbean centred event
 . This means QTBIPOC\, and especially queer and trans Caribbean folks\, to
  the front! There will be pictures and videos taken at the event by the or
 ganizer and their official photographer\, and the media taken by us can be
  used for future promo of Wine Dung events. Glow sticks will be available 
 at check-in for those who prefer not to be in any media. All funds made fr
 om this event will firstly go towards paying venue fees\, DJs\, photograph
 er\, door workers\, and organizer for their time &amp\; craft\, and second
 ly towards sustaining future Wine Dung events. All involved outside of the
  venue are QTBIPOC\, so please pay what you can! As we move to bigger venu
 es\, we have more expenses - we always strive to keep tickets as accessibl
 e as possible. Thank you for your support\, our events don&#x27\;t happen 
 without it! Please reach out to the organizer (Mars AKA DJ TRINIDADDY) thr
 ough Instagram (@winedung.to) or e-mail (winedung.to@gmail.com) with any q
 uestions or concerns &lt\;3 See you all on di dancefloor! MWAH! &lt\;3 Org
 anizer: Mars Ramlogan\, DJ TRINIDADDY ‍
LOCATION:Hail Mary\, 582 College St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/wine-dung-queeribana-fete-pt-2-w-ramz-sela
 -vie-trinidaddy-young-zee
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
