BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Kink SMARTS: Mastering Negotiation and Consent
DTSTART:20260804T200000
DTEND:20260804T200000
UID:8bc7cee1c9d04d6b864af5b695f45b8d@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Learn all about consent and kink scene negotiation in this onl
 ine workshop\, including how to use Wiley Wolfe&#x27\;s SMARTS negotiation
  acronym! What is consent in BDSM? How do we navigate consent and negotiat
 ion when we want to play with someone? This workshop explores how real-wor
 ld consent functions before\, during\, and after a scene\, as well as how 
 to apply Wiley Wolfe&#x27\;s SMARTS acronym (Safety\, Medical\, Aftercare\
 , Relationship Expectations\, Turn Ons &amp\; Thresholds\, Scene Goals) fo
 r a practical\, actionable tool to negotiate with confidence. You&#x27\;ll
  leave ready to build scenes that are both satisfying and responsible. We 
 Will Cover: Common consent frameworks\, their applications\, and their lim
 itations Different types of consent that you may will encounter in scenes 
 and dynamics What affects consent in interpersonal dynamics and specific c
 ontexts What to do if your consent is violated or a boundary is crossed Ho
 w consent looks during a scene Negotiation containers and tips to reduce p
 ressure\, manage awkward moments\, and use negotiation as a sexy anticipat
 ion-builder instead of a mood-killer How to handle &quot\;micro-scene&quot
 \; negotiation like if you&#x27\;re asked to spank someone a few times rea
 l quick at a party A deep dive of the SMARTS negotiation acronym\, the que
 stions it can include\, and how to use it This workshop will also include 
 a free neogtiation guide handout to empower all your future scenes. Want t
 o save on the full Intentional Kink series? Get the Total Desire Pass! Thi
 s also includes a FREE month of the new Wolfe Academy of Desire Patreon + 
 15% off a one-on-one coaching session. About the Instructor Wiley Wolfe (t
 hey/them) is a kink educator\, coach\, and community organizer based in To
 ronto\, Canada with 9+ years experience\, and the founder of the Wolfe Aca
 demy of Desire online educational initiative and community. Their workshop
 s have been sought after across the U.S. and Canada\, including at Dark Od
 yssey\, Kinkfest\, and Westcoast Bound\, with their online classes reachin
 g kinksters worldwide. They have worked as a Professional Dominant with hu
 ndreds of clients\, coached kinksters and couples to help them reach their
  goals\, organized 70+ community events\, led support groups\, created ero
 tic immersive theatre productions\, and more. They are currently pursuing 
 a master’s-equivalent certification in sex coaching\, and their personal
  relationships all center power exchange\, queerness\, polyamory\, and ris
 k-informed consent. Kink is their authenticity practice. They delight in g
 uiding both new and experienced players on their journeys\, with a particu
 lar focus on self-exploration\, deepening intention\, and personal growth.
  Access: This class is offered live and online through Zoom. You may need 
 to download the free\, basic version of the Zoom app to join. The class wi
 ll be recorded with the recording available to ticketholders for 7 days. A
 fter that time\, the recording will be available on Patreon for all tiers 
 that have access to the archive. Recordings will not include any open grou
 p shares at the end of class. The free guide accompanying this class will 
 be supplied at the end of class and will be downloadable for ticketholders
  to keep. It is not interactive to the class. Zoom now provides closed cap
 tioning which will be available for this event. ‍
LOCATION:Online\, online
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/kink-smarts-mastering-negotiation-and-cons
 ent
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
