 nto club explorations. downstairs starting late and ending later\, we&#x27
 \;d like to introduce to you our new resident dj/ performer KERUB. they wi
 ll be contributing and contextualizing all of our future events with no ba
 rriers. never know what to expect but come prepared for anything. particip
 ate in this evening like a show and watch the performers while socializing
  during the in between\, or like a club experience\, wandering and sociali
 zing during the performers\, or as a different thing\, what this is actual
 ly is. at jama\, the space that is the condensed version of actual known a
 nd unknown toronto. two floors. door tickets available\, but presales appr
 eciated. NOTAFLOF. come see the evidence. ‍
