DESCRIPTION:Queer Game Night. Unlimited arcade and board game plus ice bre
 ak bingo! Oh hey\, gaymers... we’re back! 🌈 Ready to Come Out™ and 
 level up your fun IRL? 🎮🍻 Join us at FreePlay Toronto for our next Q
 ueer Game Night—a place to sip\, play\, and connect with friends old and
  new. Located on College Street\, FreePlay is a retro gaming haven where y
 our entry fee unlocks unlimited arcade games for the night! 🍸 Drinks\, 
 Games &amp\; Good Vibes: Grab a drink\, share some snacks\, and dive into 
 the action! Challenge your crew (or meet new friends) with games like air 
 hockey\, Jenga\, Cards Against Humanity\, Uno\, and more. Don&#x27\;t forg
 et the icecream and slushies! 🎶 Icebreaker Activities: New to the scene
  or just want to meet some cool folks? We’ve got our icebreaker bingo ga
 me to make mingling fun and easy. Plus colour coded wristbands to make it 
 easy to spot who&#x27\;s single and who&#x27\;s looking for friends. 💥 
 Arcade &amp\; Board Game Fun: From nostalgic arcade classics to your favor
 ite board games\, there’s something for everyone to enjoy. 🕹️🎲
 ✨ Who’s ready to mingle? 📅 Date: Thursday\, August 6th 🕖 Time: 8
 pm - late 📍 Location: 300 College St\, Toronto 🎫 Early bird: $10 Gen
 eral Admission $15 ‍
