BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tawoos presents: LMNL Sessions Vol. 1
DTSTART:20260816T170000
DTEND:20260816T170000
UID:16cb42f11061fca97edce087d99a0008@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:LMNL Sessions is here! And we&#x27\;re kicking things off with
  a very special day party. Created to celebrate the future of South Asian 
 electronic music\, LMNL Sessions is a concert series designed to take audi
 ences on sonic journeys across genres\, cultures\, people\, and generation
 s. Each edition brings together artists who are redefining the sound of th
 e SASWANA region\, creating space for discovery\, connection\, and communi
 ty on and off the dancefloor. For Vol. 1\, we&#x27\;re travelling across I
 ndia\, Bangladesh\, and Tunisia\, featuring a lineup that bridges generati
 ons of artists! From the legendary Discostan\, celebrating 15 years of gro
 undbreaking work decolonizing the dance floor\, to a new wave of phenomena
 l talent with Dameer\, Rou-H\, and Sär\, each pushing the needle through 
 innovative edits\, original productions\, and live vocals. Line Up: Discos
 tan Dameer Rou-H Sār Expect an immersive summer evening filled with nosta
 lgic tunes\, intertwined with forward-thinking sounds\, beautiful curation
 \, and the kind of musical discoveries that stay with you long after the n
 ight ends. ‍
LOCATION:Standard Time\, 165 Geary Avenue #2nd Floor Unit A
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/tawoos-presents-lmnl-sessions-vol-1
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Worldbringer&#x27\;s Blabberjam
DTSTART:20260816T170000
DTEND:20260816T170000
UID:1b9ba0178e1b10b4ce70c3de5ffb6ad5@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:World Building &amp\; Map making Night great for Writers\, Gam
 e masters\, home brewers and even TTRPG players that want to be more speci
 fic about their backstories. Let&#x27\;s build dynamic worlds together and
  build the worlds we want to see When: August 16th\, 5PM - 8PM Where: Thre
 e Dollar Bill Bar\, 1592 Queen St W\, Parkdale\, Toronto M6R 1A8 Who: You!
  Bring 1 friend Cost: Free Masked event ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
 ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~ Roll for Initiative... on Making Friends! URGENT QUEST ALE
 RT Calling all Queer Adventurers\, writers\, and interesting individuals! 
 The World builders at Three Dollar Bill seek creative imagineers on the 3r
 d Sunday of the month for an epic gathering. Whether you&#x27\;re a season
 ed world sculptor or have never turned ideas to paper\, we want to connect
 . Map Making - MAPS! what are they? and how do you make one to suit your n
 eeds? where does my island go?how might fantastical elements affect your w
 orld? in this introductory class we will go over map making in its base el
 ements and address some of the pitfalls and pigeonholes of the craft\, we 
 will connect you with world building resources we&#x27\;ve found useful. O
 ur goal is to demystify mapmaking\, and make getting into it more accessib
 le. World Sharing- Think of a symposium\, and or a gay lil&#x27\; party fo
 r discussing your hyperfixations\, worlds\, climates\, and cultures you&#x
 27\;ve made. How is the oligarchy in your kingdom challenged? why are your
  elves not like other elves? how does the rainy season impact your charact
 er&#x27\;s motivations and conflicts? does your planet even orbit a star??
  WHAT IS THE KOPPEN CLIMATE MAP AND WHY IS IT STARING BACK AT ME? talk to 
 your fellow queer peers and infodump\, listen\, or (unavoidably) interject
  about your favourite fantasy\, sci-fi and speculative topics! (ﮧOﮧ) K
 araoke Finale - End the night sharing harrowing tales and singing bardic b
 allads in the tavern! All skill levels welcome No gatekeeping allowed. All
  energies Welcome! Your journey to forge friendships starts here! A New Wo
 rld awaits! ‍
LOCATION:Three Dollar Bill\, 1592 Queen Street West
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/worldbringers-blabberjam
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
