DTEND:20260821T190000
UID:63d91bc0dd3dc7a659df717fefa0cc4d@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:All things clubs\, across 100+ pages. Editorials from Albert H
 oang\, Roya DelSol\, Jibril Yassin\, Christopher Sherman and Isaac Nikolai
  Fox. Lore 004: The Cult Issue After months of photoshoots and article-edi
 ting\, we&#x27\;re excited to announce that we&#x27\;re taking over Rhythm
  (141 Bathurst St\, Suite 101) for the launch of our fourth print edition.
  This time around\, we&#x27\;ve stepped it up even further\, with more wil
 d stories and original photoshoots. Everything&#x27\;s debuting Aug. 21\, 
 and we&#x27\;re planning all the good chaos. You&#x27\;ll get to hang out 
 in a cute space with creative folks of all stripes\, meet everyone who bro
 ught the magazine to life\, see installations of all the photography— an
 d buy copies of the magazine to take home with you. You in? The mission: C
 elebrate everyone&#x27\;s brilliant creative work—and help make sure we 
 can do many more of these. One of our team&#x27\;s real beliefs is that th
 e arts should be sustainable\, and this party is how we pay friends to do 
 wild creative work. Have a few cocktails\, buy a copy of the magazine\, an
 d dress your best. &lt\;3 Location Rhythm Toronto\, right near Bathurst an
 d Richmond. Paid parking is available across the street at Impark - 111 Ba
 thurst St. Lot 506\, so there&#x27\;s spots nearby. Event Itinerary: 7:00:
  Reception + Party 9:00: Masthead Remarks / Contributor Highlights 10:00: 
 Post-Reception\, Party and Yap (+ more cute DJ sets) 1:30: Go home and sle
 ep &lt\;3 We&#x27\;lll see you there! -- Team Lore ‍
LOCATION:Rhythm\, 141 Bathurst St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/lore-004-the-club-issue
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
